formulas.derivation:
Conversion of delivery pressure gauge reading in kg/cm² to equivalent meters of water column:

1 \text{ kg/cm}^2 = 9.81 \times 10^4 \text{ N/m}^2

H_d = \frac{P_d \times 9.81 \times 10^4}{1000 \times 9.81} = P_d \times 10 \text{ (m)}

Volumetric collection in a 0.35 m × 0.35 m tank for 0.1 m water level rise:

\text{Volume} = 0.35 \times 0.35 \times 0.1 = 0.01225 \text{ m}^3

Q_{act} = \frac{0.01225}{t} \text{ (m³/s)}
